# Lab core

```text
Web ──HTTP──► API Gateway ──RMQ RPC──► Trip | Booking | Payment
                                    ↕ eventos domínio (bus.events)
Grafana LGTM (:3005) ← OTLP

apps/api/api-gateway/src/app/
  controllers/ services/ guards/ pipes/

packages/common  ← contratos + topics/queues
packages/events  ← seat.* / payment.*
```

Booking dono da Reservation. Payment dono do Payment. Trip projeta assentos.

Idempotência obrigatória em reserva e pagamento.
